    "name": {
      "text": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
      "data": {
        "ru": {
          "original": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
          "translation": "\u0421\u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0443\u0431\u043e\u0440\u0449\u0438\u043a 6000 SUX"
        },
        "es": {
          "original": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
          "translation": "Ca\u00f1\u00f3n de nieve"
        },
        "de": {
          "original": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
          "translation": "Schneeschleuder 6000 SUX"
        },
        "pt": {
          "original": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
          "translation": "SnowThrower\u2122 6000 SUX"
        },
        "fr": {
          "original": "SnowThrower 6000 SUX",
          "translation": "NivoAtomiseur 6000"
        }
      }
    },
    "description": {
      "text": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
      "data": {
        "ru": {
          "original": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
          "translation": "\u0417\u0430\u0441\u044b\u043f\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0430\u0433\u0430 \u043b\u0435\u0434\u044f\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0441\u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e\u043c \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e \u0441\u043e\u043e\u0440\u0443\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u0437 \u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0441\u043d\u0435\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0431\u043b\u043e\u043a\u0438 (<BINDING_CAST2>). \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043a\u043e \u043e\u0442 \u0441\u043d\u0435\u0436\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043b\u0435\u0434\u044f\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0431\u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430, \u0432\u0430\u0448 \u0431\u043e\u0435\u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435."
        },
        "es": {
          "original": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
          "translation": "<BINDING_CAST1> para ralentizar y herir a los enemigos con una r\u00e1faga de nieve. <BINDING_CAST2> para colocar bloques de nieve r\u00e1pidamente. La capacidad de municiones ser\u00e1 limitada al estar lejos de bloques de hielo o nieve."
        },
        "de": {
          "original": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
          "translation": "Verlangsame und verletze deine Gegner mit einer Explosion aus eisigem Schnee! Nutz die <BINDING_CAST2>, um Schneebl\u00f6cke schnell zu platzieren. Limitierte Munition, wenn kein Schnee oder Eis in der N\u00e4he ist."
        },
        "pt": {
          "original": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
          "translation": "Desacelere e cause dano nos inimigos com uma rajada de neve congelante, ou aperte <BINDING_CAST2> para depositar blocos de neve rapidamente. Limite de muni\u00e7\u00e3o limitado quando n\u00e3o h\u00e1 Neve ou Blocos de Gelo por perto."
        },
        "fr": {
          "original": "Slow and damage enemies with a blast of freezing snow, or <BINDING_CAST2> to quickly deposit snow blocks. Limited ammo capacity when away from Snow or Ice Blocks.",
          "translation": "Ralentissez vos ennemis et ensevelissez-les sous une tonne de neige glac\u00e9e, ou placez rapidement des blocs de neige en utilisant l'action secondaire (<BINDING_CAST2>). Capacit\u00e9 en munitions limit\u00e9e si vous \u00eates hors de port\u00e9e d'un bloc de glace ou d'un bloc de neige."
        }
      }
    },
